<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.38 vs   7.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.95 vs  37.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.03 vs   4.12</p>
<p> Sales		   61.82 vs  66.31</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.62 vs  14.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	20.75 vs  61.77</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.38 vs  19.45</p>
<p> Sales		  265.05 vs 264.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trading</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
